From bd0f018a27daadde563f6b757c4e03ecd128d494 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: VLM <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:10:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(scripts): opt-in WebSocket for app scripts, limited to
 allowed origins

PUBLIC_SCRIPT_WEBSOCKET_ORIGINS lists the origins scripts may connect to.
Unset means scripts get no WebSocket (today's behaviour). Scripts receive a
small wrapper, not the native socket, and an app's sockets close when it is
torn down.
